P55,P55-press-the-styled-button.actions,effect,"clicks: 2, pressed draws: 1 (above 0), total draws: 22.",
P56,P56-jump-to-row-59.actions,effect,"""asked to scroll to: 59"" and rows 46-59 are on screen, with row 59 the last one.",
P57,P57-scroll-the-whole-list.actions,defect,"Pointer was over the list (row 7 shows the hover highlight) and 60 HID wheel events were posted at the same window-local point as the passing AppKit run. update-stats rose by one per event, so the app received them, yet the list stays on row 0 and reads 205 / 205 (none released; AppKit reads 500/19). The GTK List did not scroll with the wheel.",
P58,P58-left-to-L30.actions,defect,"The click landed (""asked to scroll to: L30""), but BOTH columns scrolled: L30 and R30 are both at the bottom, and the right column must stay at R0. No per-column scrollbars are visible, and rows draw clipped under the text above them, so on GTK the two ScrollViews seem to scroll as one.",
P58,P58-right-to-R45.actions,defect,"The click landed (""asked to scroll to: R45""), but BOTH columns scrolled: L45 and R45 are both at the bottom, and the left column must not move. This is the same shared-scroll behaviour as the left-to-L30 file.",
P59,P59-two-windows-one-typed.actions,missed,"Window A reads scene=AAAAAA app=AAAAAA. The log shows a start at AAA, three appends and window B scene=(empty) app=AAAAAA, but there is no clear. The clear click (220,239) lands in the gap left of the clear button. Scene/app separation itself behaved correctly.","click 255,236 frame (clear)"
