P64,P64-measure-the-frame-clock.actions,effect,PASS 1 TICKS 114 in 1.93s -> 58.4 Hz; median gap 16.7ms.,
P65,P65-drag-pinch-and-rotate.actions,defect,"Drag works (drag ENDED translation (140, 30)), but magnify and rotate both read ""(none yet)"". The pinch and rotate HID gesture events were posted over the orange and green panels (local 210,210 and 210,114, inside the panels), and GtkBackend's magnify/rotate gestures never fired.",
P66,P66-animation-samples.actions,effect,SAMPLES 28 over 0.58s; first 0.0 last 200.0; monotonic yes. The log has BOOL assignments: 1.,
P67,P67-accessibility-names.actions,unclear,"Renders the four buttons, but the pass condition is an external ax_dump of the AX tree, and that was not run during the sweep; nothing in the capture or logs shows the AX names.",
